I don't even know what the TITLE means. Oh, I know I could probably look it up 
and find out, sure. But, here's the thing- I don't care. I am not a linguist or 
logician. I have no interest whatsoever IN understanding. Figuring out how the 
language works isn't my job. That job belongs to the linguists and logicians. 
They figure out how a word works, then they tell us, in layman's terms, once 
they've figured it out. The whole zo'e thing going on is exactly that- something 
they are figuring out.

I've got enough stuff on my "to learn" plate being in college without putting 
the learning of an entirely new discipline on there too- especially one that I'm 
not interested in anyway. If I don't /need/ to learn it, and I don't /want/ to 
learn it, I'm not going to learn it. Simple as that. Get back to me when you 
figure out what zo'e means.

 

